                                "sense_id": "2be18d80-9c39-320e-a281-7446f0f0ce37",
                                "text": "Windhauch, Windhauch, sagte Kohelet, Windhauch, Windhauch, das ist alles Windhauch.",
                                "translation": "Vanity of vanities, saith the Preacher, vanity of vanities; all is vanitiy. (Ecclesiastes 1:2)",
